 """Hybrid Triton/cuBLAS outgoing Triangle Multiplicative Update forward.
 
 Triton computes input layer norm and packs gated left/right activations into
-[B * H, N, N] BF16 matrices.  The cubic contraction is delegated to cuBLAS
-batched BF16 GEMM, followed by a Triton output layer norm/gate and a final
-cuBLAS projection.  C=128 keeps the sensitive output gate in FP32 while larger
-channel cases use one packed BF16 projection for all five hidden tensors.
+[B * H, N, N] low-precision matrices.  C=128 uses FP16 for the first norm,
+packed projection, and batched contraction; larger channel cases use BF16.
